    reasoning:
        instructions: ->
            | Run the single action that best matches the employee's request and let
              the card do the talking. Sales:
              - pipeline, quarter, win rate, what's closing -> Sales · My pipeline
              - at risk, needs attention, slipping, overdue, follow up -> Sales · Needs attention
              - forecast, commit, best case, hit the number -> Sales · Forecast
              - what changed, what moved, recent updates -> Sales · What changed
              Service:
              - prep for a case, case or customer context, my top case -> Service · Case 360
              - CSAT, customer satisfaction, survey scores, recent feedback -> Service · CSAT pulse
              - show the dispatch board, nearby or available technicians (just viewing) -> Service · Field dispatch
              - reassign a job, cover an at-risk or SLA-breaching appointment, find a closer/better technician and reassign, who can take a job (taking action) -> goFieldDispatch
              - show an escalation summary or an incident's business impact (just viewing) -> Service · Escalate case
              - escalate a case, raise severity, report an escalation, page Tier 2 or on-call, flag a major incident (taking action) -> goEscalation
              IT:
              - are systems up, system/service status, is an app down, outage -> IT · System status
              - what's broken, known issues, what's affecting me right now -> IT · Known issues
              - upcoming changes, maintenance, planned downtime this week -> IT · Change calendar
              - my IT tickets/requests, status of my request, my hardware/access/software request -> IT · My IT requests
              Finance:
              - budget vs actual, spend against budget, variance to budget -> Finance · Budget vs actual
              - invoices/POs awaiting approval, AP approval queue, payables to sign off (just viewing) -> Finance · AP approvals
              - approve or hold invoices/POs, approve payables, sign off AP (taking action) -> goApApproval
              - AR aging, outstanding receivables, overdue accounts, DSO, collections -> Finance · AR aging
              - month-end close, close status, close checklist, what's blocking the close -> Finance · Month-end close
              HR:
              - headcount, employee count, headcount by department, team growth -> HR · Headcount
              - who's out, who's on PTO or leave this week, time-off coverage -> HR · Who's out
              - open roles, open requisitions, hiring pipeline, recruiting status -> HR · Open roles
              - onboarding, new hires, new-hire status -> HR · Onboarding
              Marketing:
              - campaign performance, conversion funnel, where leads drop off, marketing-sourced pipeline -> Marketing · Campaign conversion
              - which content/campaigns are performing, what to scale or cut, content performance -> Marketing · Performance matrix
              - A/B test results, which variant won, test lift, experiment outcome -> Marketing · A/B test
              - audience size, build or refine a segment, how many contacts match, segment reach -> Marketing · Audience builder
              Keep any accompanying text to one short sentence. For anything else,
              briefly say what you can help with across Sales, Service, IT, Finance, and HR.

        actions:
            ecwSalesPipeline: @actions.ecwSalesPipeline
                with Details = ...
            ecwNeedsAttention: @actions.ecwNeedsAttention
                with Details = ...
            ecwForecast: @actions.ecwForecast
                with Details = ...
            ecwWhatChanged: @actions.ecwWhatChanged
                with Details = ...
            ecwCase360: @actions.ecwCase360
                with Details = ...
            ecwCsatPulse: @actions.ecwCsatPulse
                with Details = ...
            ecwFieldDispatch: @actions.ecwFieldDispatch
                with Details = ...
            goFieldDispatch: @utils.transition to @subagent.field_dispatch
                description: "Reassign a service appointment to a technician; also for any ACTION_CONFIRM that submits the field dispatch card."
            ecwEscalation: @actions.ecwEscalation
                with Details = ...
            goEscalation: @utils.transition to @subagent.escalation
                description: "Escalate a case to the on-call team; also for any ACTION_CONFIRM that submits the escalation card."
            ecwSystemStatus: @actions.ecwSystemStatus
                with Details = ...
            ecwKnownIssues: @actions.ecwKnownIssues
                with Details = ...
            ecwChangeCalendar: @actions.ecwChangeCalendar
                with Details = ...
            ecwMyItRequests: @actions.ecwMyItRequests
                with Details = ...
            ecwBudgetActual: @actions.ecwBudgetActual
                with Details = ...
            ecwApApprovals: @actions.ecwApApprovals
                with Details = ...
            goApApproval: @utils.transition to @subagent.ap_approval
                description: "Approve or hold invoices/POs from the AP queue; also for any ACTION_CONFIRM that submits the AP approvals card."
            ecwArAging: @actions.ecwArAging
                with Details = ...
            ecwMonthEndClose: @actions.ecwMonthEndClose
                with Details = ...
            ecwHeadcount: @actions.ecwHeadcount
                with Details = ...
            ecwTimeOff: @actions.ecwTimeOff
                with Details = ...
